title: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits › Verify › Fill in the form
route: /authorizations/eligibility/verify
intro: The form on the left of 'Verify a patient'. Add an insurance card, pick a sample, or type the details. 'Check now' stays off until the four required answers look complete.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: any file counts as a card. The payer comes from the file name, or Summit if none matches.
---
start s1 "Open 'Verify a patient'"
screen sc "Verify a patient\n'The agents check coverage and benefits live, so you know whether the clinic will be paid.'\nCard 'The patient and the service' with the pill 'Privacy mode on'"
click b1 "Click '← Eligibility & Benefits' (back link)"
click b2 "Click '← Back to referral RF-2040' or '← Back to case R-1042'\nShown only when the address names a referral (see 'Ways in and pre-fill')"
goto g3 "Continues in: Authorizations › New case › Referral › The full referral page"
goto g0 "Continues in: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits › List › What the screen shows"

group gSample "Try a sample"
  click f5 "Click a chip in the row 'Try a sample'\n'Cleared to bill', 'Coverage lapsed', 'Not found',\n'Not covered', 'Another plan pays first', 'Limit reached'"
  process p7 "Fills the whole form with a made-up member who ends that way\nThe chip turns green. Initials and age are remembered for the result"
endgroup

group gCard "Add the insurance card"
  input f1 "Drop a file, or click the drop zone\n'Drag and drop the insurance card, or click to select a file'"
  click f2 "Click 'Use sample file'"
  click f3 "Click 'Use sample card' (top right)"
  agent a1 "Reader reads the card\n'Reader is reading the card' for about 1 second"
  process p1 "Fills payer from the file name (else Summit) and a member ID\nDate of birth stays empty"
  process p2 "Fills Summit, 'SM7403964821', 03/14/1992, Residential 3.5, 10/21/2026\nRemembers J.M., 34"
  toast t1 "'Sample card loaded'\n'Reader filled in the details for J.M., 34. The check can start when you are ready.'"
  screen cs "Card strip 'Card read just now'\n'Payer, member ID and plan type are filled in below'"
  click f4 "Click 'Replace'"
  process p3 "Strip goes, drop zone returns\nThe typed values stay"
endgroup

group gFields "Type the details"
  input i1 "'Payer' menu: 'Choose a payer', six payers\n(label reads 'Payer (read from card)' after a card)"
  input i2 "'State': the only choice is 'Ohio'"
  input i3 "'Member ID (removed before analysis)'\nHint 'Agents see …4821 only'"
  input i4 "'Date of birth' as MM/DD/YYYY"
  input i5 "'Program': 'Residential 3.5', 'IOP', 'PHP', 'Detox'"
  input i6 "'Date of service' as MM/DD/YYYY, starts as 10/21/2026"
endgroup

decision q1 "Payer chosen, member ID has 4 or more letters or digits, both dates shaped MM/DD/YYYY?"
process p4 "'Check now' is off\nHint 'Add the payer, member ID, date of birth and date of service to check.'"
process p5 "Only the shape of a date is checked, not whether it is a real day"
process p6 "'Check now' is on\nHint 'Takes about 10 seconds. Nothing is changed at the payer or in the record.'"
click c1 "Click 'Check now'"
goto g1 "Continues in: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits › Verify › The live check"
goto g2 "Continues in: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits › Verify › Try a sample"

s1 --> sc
sc --> b1 --> g0
sc --> b2 --> g3
sc --> f5 --> p7 --> q1
f5 -.-> g2
sc --> f1 --> a1
sc --> f2 --> a1
a1 --> p1 --> cs
sc --> f3 --> p2 --> t1 --> cs
cs --> f4 --> p3
sc --> i1 --> i2 --> i3 --> i4 --> i5 --> i6 --> q1
cs --> q1
p3 --> q1
q1 -->|No| p4 -.-> p5
p4 --> q1
q1 -->|Yes| p6 --> c1 --> g1
